================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

FileMaker plug-in API (FMWrapper headers and libraries)
------------------------------------------------------
The FMWrapper headers and link libraries are part of the Claris FileMaker
External Plug-In API, Copyright (c) Claris International Inc. (see the notice at
the top of each header file). They come from the official FileMaker Plug-In SDK
and are used under the BSD-style license printed in each header, which permits
redistribution provided the copyright notice is retained. These files are NOT
covered by the ZooImage license above, and are not redistributed in this
repository — obtain them from the Claris FileMaker Plug-In SDK.

nlohmann/json
-------------
JSON parsing and serialization in the plug-in uses nlohmann/json (single-header,
vendored at plugin/third_party/nlohmann/json.hpp) under the MIT License:

    Copyright (c) 2013-2022 Niels Lohmann
    https://github.com/nlohmann/json

Tauri and the helper's Rust / JavaScript dependencies
-----------------------------------------------------
The bundled helper app (ZooImage.app) is built with Tauri v2 and links a number
of Rust crates and JavaScript packages, all under permissive licenses (MIT and/or
Apache-2.0). Each component, its version, license and copyright holder is listed
in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

None of the third-party components above impose copyleft obligations. The only
obligation is attribution, which this file and THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md satisfy.
